or:inherit;color:#FFFFFF;font-family:&quot;Fira Sans&quot;;font-size:12.0pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:left;direction:ltr;\">​</p><p style=\"font-weight:300;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;background-color:inherit;color:#FFFFFF;font-family:&quot;Fira Sans&quot;;font-size:12.0pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:left;direction:ltr;\">​</p><p style=\"font-weight:300;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;background-color:inherit;color:#FFFFFF;font-family:&quot;Fira Sans&quot;;font-size:12.0pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:left;direction:ltr;\">​</p><p style=\"font-weight:300;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;background-color:inherit;color:#FFFFFF;font-family:&quot;Fira Sans&quot;;font-size:12.0pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:left;direction:ltr;\">​</p><p style=\"font-weight:300;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;background-color:inherit;color:#FFFFFF;font-family:&quot;Fira Sans&quot;;font-size:12.0pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:left;direction:ltr;\">​</p><p style=\"font-weight:300;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;background-color:inherit;color:#FFFFFF;font-family:&quot;Fira Sans&quot;;font-size:12.0pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:left;direction:ltr;\">​</p><p style=\"font-weight:300;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;background-color:inherit;color:#FFFFFF;font-family:&quot;Fira Sans&quot;;font-size:12.0pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:left;direction:ltr;\">​</p><p style=\"font-weight:300;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;background-color:inherit;color:#FFFFFF;font-family:&quot;Fira Sans&quot;;font-size:12.0pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:left;direction:ltr;\">​</p><p style=\"font-weight:300;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;background-color:inherit;color:#FFFFFF;font-family:&quot;Fira Sans&quot;;font-size:12.0pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:left;direction:ltr;\">​</p></div></section></div>",
    "slide": "Slide 2",
    "text": "2 of 9\n\nIntroduction & problem\n\nDashboard authors currently choose a question-based or advanced widget and configure it manually. They need a simpler way to express a custom visualization using their selected survey questions.\n\n​\n\nBuild with AI introduces a guided, prompt-based entry point for setting up and placing a custom widget on a dashboard.\n\n​\n\n​\n\n​\n\n​\n\n​\n\n​\n\n​\n\n​\n\n​"
  },
