    "html": "<div role=\"group\" class=\"slide\" title=\"Slide 3\"><h1 class=\"offscreen-header\">3 of 9</h1><section class=\"slide-content\" aria-label=\"Slide 3\" aria-roledescription=\"Content\" title=\"Slide content\" style=\"overflow:hidden;width:960px; height:540px;background-image: url(https://docs.google.com/presentation/u/0/d/1phTGhNljt0Lm4xdJqAllgeQ3HvWmTf9tbeTQCxQcu4U/viewpage?pageid=g86f1215a00_0_12&amp;rev=3213&amp;hmac=ALf4PZ4sKDe2_2MuNJvoJtV_374PX2TU4Q&amp;ts=1791117481&amp;w=960&amp;h=540&amp;format=png&amp;showText=0);\"><div class=\"shape\" title=\"\" style=\"width:906px; height:25px; top:43px; left:43px\"><p style=\"font-weight:500;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;background-color:inherit;color:#1B87E6;font-family:&quot;Fira Sans&quot;;font-size:16.0pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:left;direction:ltr;\">User journey</p></div><div class=\"shape\" title=\"\" style=\"width:753px; height:233px; top:133px; left:87px\"><ol class=\"list-kix_cuqauafe0mpv-0 start\"><style>ol.list-kix_cuqauafe0mpv-0.start { counter-reset: counter-kix_cuqauafe0mpv-0 0 }ol.list-kix_cuqauafe0mpv-0 > li { counter-increment: counter-kix_cuqauafe0mpv-0; list-style-type: none }ol.list-kix_cuqauafe0mpv-0 > li:before { content: counter(counter-kix_cuqauafe0mpv-0, decimal) \".\" \" \"}</style><li value=\"1\" style=\"font-weight:300;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;background-color:inherit;color:#666666;font-family:&quot;Fira Sans&quot;;font-size:12.0pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:left;direction:ltr;\">Open a BI dashboard → Add widget → Build with AI.</li><li value=\"2\" style=\"font-weight:300;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;background-color:inherit;color:#666666;font-family:&quot;Fira Sans&quot;;font-size:12.0pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:left;direction:ltr;\">Enter a widget name and click Next.</li><li value=\"3\" style=\"font-weight:300;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;background-color:inherit;color:#666666;font-family:&quot;Fira Sans&quot;;font-size:12.0pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:left;direction:ltr;\">Select one survey from the survey browser.</li><li value=\"4\" style=\"font-weight:300;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;background-color:inherit;color:#666666;font-family:&quot;Fira Sans&quot;;font-size:12.0pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:left;direction:ltr;\">Check one or more questions and click Next.</li><li value=\"5\" style=\"font-weight:300;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;background-color:inherit;color:#666666;font-family:&quot;Fira Sans&quot;;font-size:12.0pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:left;direction:ltr;\">Enter an optional description and click Create widget.</li><li value=\"6\" style=\"font-weight:300;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;background-color:inherit;color:#666666;font-family:&quot;Fira Sans&quot;;font-size:12.0pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:left;direction:ltr;\">Review the placeholder in the current dashboard tab.</li><li value=\"7\" style=\"font-weight:300;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;background-color:inherit;color:#666666;font-family:&quot;Fira Sans&quot;;font-size:12.0pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:left;direction:ltr;\">Use the three-dot menu → Settings to edit name or highlight.</li><li value=\"8\" style=\"font-weight:300;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;background-color:inherit;color:#666666;font-family:&quot;Fira Sans&quot;;font-size:12.0pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:left;direction:ltr;\">Reuse the widget from Advanced widgets.</li></ol></div></section></div>",
    "slide": "Slide 3",
    "text": "3 of 9\n\nUser journey\n\nOpen a BI dashboard → Add widget → Build with AI.\nEnter a widget name and click Next.\nSelect one survey from the survey browser.\nCheck one or more questions and click Next.\nEnter an optional description and click Create widget.\nReview the placeholder in the current dashboard tab.\nUse the three-dot menu → Settings to edit name or highlight.\nReuse the widget from Advanced widgets."
  },
