    "html": "<div role=\"group\" class=\"slide\" title=\"Slide 4\"><h1 class=\"offscreen-header\">4 of 9</h1><section class=\"slide-content\" aria-label=\"Slide 4\" aria-roledescription=\"Content\" title=\"Slide content\" style=\"overflow:hidden;width:960px; height:540px;background-image: url(https://docs.google.com/presentation/u/0/d/1phTGhNljt0Lm4xdJqAllgeQ3HvWmTf9tbeTQCxQcu4U/viewpage?pageid=g8709499aee_5_33&amp;rev=3213&amp;hmac=ALf4PZ4sKDe2_2MuNJvoJtV_374PX2TU4Q&amp;ts=1791117481&amp;w=960&amp;h=540&amp;format=png&amp;showText=0);\"><div class=\"shape\" title=\"\" style=\"width:890px; height:25px; top:42px; left:43px\"><p style=\"font-weight:500;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;background-color:inherit;color:#1B87E6;font-family:&quot;Fira Sans&quot;;font-size:16.0pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:left;direction:ltr;\">Business rules: setup</p></div><div class=\"shape\" title=\"\" style=\"width:752px; height:19px; top:92px; left:48px\"><p style=\"font-weight:700;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;background-color:inherit;color:#666666;font-family:&quot;Fira Sans&quot;;font-size:12.0pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:left;direction:ltr;\">One survey, multiple questions<span style=\"font-weight:400;\"></span></p></div><div class=\"shape\" title=\"\" style=\"width:790px; height:132px; top:131px; left:57px\"><ul class=\"list-kix_wwiq9jcs5hfj-0\"><style>ul.list-kix_wwiq9jcs5hfj-0 > li  { list-style-type: none }ul.list-kix_wwiq9jcs5hfj-0 > li:before { content: \"●\" \" \"}</style><li value=\"1\" style=\"font-weight:300;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;background-color:inherit;color:#666666;font-family:&quot;Fira Sans&quot;;font-size:12.0pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:left;direction:ltr;\">Name is required; whitespace alone cannot advance (100 characters maximum).</li><li value=\"2\" style=\"font-weight:300;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;background-color:inherit;color:#666666;font-family:&quot;Fira Sans&quot;;font-size:12.0pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:left;direction:ltr;\">Select exactly one survey and at least one question.</li><li value=\"3\" style=\"font-weight:300;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;background-color:inherit;color:#666666;font-family:&quot;Fira Sans&quot;;font-size:12.0pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:left;direction:ltr;\">Use the shared survey picker and question table with checkboxes.</li><li value=\"4\" style=\"font-weight:300;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;background-color:inherit;color:#666666;font-family:&quot;Fira Sans&quot;;font-size:12.0pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:left;direction:ltr;\">Changing the survey clears question selections; Back preserves other details.</li><li value=\"5\" style=\"font-weight:300;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;background-color:inherit;color:#666666;font-family:&quot;Fira Sans&quot;;font-size:12.0pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:left;direction:ltr;\">Description is optional and does not change the placeholder.</li><li value=\"6\" style=\"font-weight:300;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;background-color:inherit;color:#666666;font-family:&quot;Fira Sans&quot;;font-size:12.0pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:left;direction:ltr;\">Closing the builder before creation adds nothing.</li></ul></div></section></div>",
    "slide": "Slide 4",
    "text": "4 of 9\n\nBusiness rules: setup\n\nOne survey, multiple questions\n\nName is required; whitespace alone cannot advance (100 characters maximum).\nSelect exactly one survey and at least one question.\nUse the shared survey picker and question table with checkboxes.\nChanging the survey clears question selections; Back preserves other details.\nDescription is optional and does not change the placeholder.\nClosing the builder before creation adds nothing."
  },
  {
    "html": "<div role=\"group\" class=\"slide\" title=\"Slide 5\"><h1 class=\"offscreen-header\">5 of 9</h1><section class=\"slide-content\" aria-label=\"Slide 5\" aria-roledescription=\"Content\" title=\"Slide content\" style=\"overflow:hidden;width:960px; height:540px;background-image: url(https://docs.google.com/presentation/u/0/d/1phTGhNljt0Lm4xdJqAllgeQ3HvWmTf9tbeTQCxQcu4U/viewpage?pageid=g86f1215a00_0_64&amp;rev=3213&amp;hmac=ALf4PZ4sKDe2_2MuNJvoJtV_374PX2TU4Q&amp;ts=1791117481&amp;w=960&amp;h=540&amp;format=png&amp;showText=0);\"><div class=\"shape\" title=\"\" style=\"width:854px; height:164px; top:108px; left:52px\"><ul class=\"list-kix_u8be6e4hgo5s-0\"><style>ul.list-kix_u8be6e4hgo5s-0 > li  { list-style-type: none }ul.list-kix_u8be6e4hgo5s-0 > li:before { content: \"●\" \" \"}</style><li value=\"1\" style=\"font-weight:300;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;background-color:inherit;color:#666666;font-family:&quot;Fira Sans&quot;;font-size:12.0pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:left;direction:ltr;\">Create widget adds one placeholder to the current tab and closes the builder.</li><li value=\"2\" style=\"font-weight:300;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;background-color:inherit;color:#666666;font-family:&quot;Fira Sans&quot;;font-size:12.0pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:left;direction:ltr;\">No copy/paste handoff or preview checkpoint is shown.</li><li value=\"3\" style=\"font-weight:300;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;background-color:inherit;color:#666666;font-family:&quot;Fira Sans&quot;;font-size:12.0pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:left;direction:ltr;\">Use the standard title, divider and three-dot menu; no AI badge above the name.</li><li value=\"4\" style=\"font-weight:300;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;background-color:inherit;color:#666666;font-family:&quot;Fira Sans&quot;;font-size:12.0pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:left;direction:ltr;\">General settings edit name and highlight text (up to 500 characters).</li><li value=\"5\" style=\"font-weight:300;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;background-color:inherit;color:#666666;font-family:&quot;Fira Sans&quot;;font-size:12.0pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:left;direction:ltr;\">Advanced widgets lists created widgets; reused copies have independent settings.</li><li value=\"6\" style=\"font-weight:300;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;background-color:inherit;color:#666666;font-family:&quot;Fira Sans&quot;;font-size:12.0pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:left;direction:ltr;\">Widget storage and lifecycle follow the agreed dashboard persistence requirements.</li></ul></div><div class=\"shape\" title=\"\" style=\"width:890px; height:25px; top:42px; left:43px\"><p style=\"font-weight:500;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;background-color:inherit;color:#1B87E6;font-family:&quot;Fira Sans&quot;;font-size:16.0pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:left;direction:ltr;\">Business rules: widget behavior</p></div></section></div>",
    "slide": "Slide 5",
    "text": "5 of 9\nCreate widget adds one placeholder to the current tab and closes the builder.\nNo copy/paste handoff or preview checkpoint is shown.\nUse the standard title, divider and three-dot menu; no AI badge above the name.\nGeneral settings edit name and highlight text (up to 500 characters).\nAdvanced widgets lists created widgets; reused copies have independent settings.\nWidget storage and lifecycle follow the agreed dashboard persistence requirements.\n\nBusiness rules: widget behavior"
  },
