ction API discovery, data-contract mapping and backend integration.</li><li value=\"3\" style=\"font-weight:300;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;background-color:inherit;color:#666666;font-family:&quot;Fira Sans&quot;;font-size:12.0pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:left;direction:ltr;\">Filters, weight schemes, slicers and Design/Analytics/Labels tabs.</li><li value=\"4\" style=\"font-weight:300;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;background-color:inherit;color:#666666;font-family:&quot;Fira Sans&quot;;font-size:12.0pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:left;direction:ltr;\">Persistent storage, custom-widget exports and shared-view integration.</li><li value=\"5\" style=\"font-weight:300;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;background-color:inherit;color:#666666;font-family:&quot;Fira Sans&quot;;font-size:12.0pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:left;direction:ltr;\">Analytical results: the current card is a placeholder only.</li></ul></div></section></div>",
