ght:300;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;background-color:inherit;color:#666666;font-family:&quot;Fira Sans&quot;;font-size:12.0pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:left;direction:ltr;\">Description is optional, up to 6,000 characters.</li><li value=\"5\" style=\"font-weight:300;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;background-color:inherit;color:#666666;font-family:&quot;Fira Sans&quot;;font-size:12.0pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:left;direction:ltr;\">Create a standard BI card with General settings and reuse from Advanced widgets.</li></ul></div></section></div>",
