nt-size:12.0pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:left;direction:ltr;\">Any prompt, including blank, creates one placeholder with no extra dialog.</li><li value=\"3\" style=\"font-weight:300;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;background-color:inherit;color:#666666;font-family:&quot;Fira Sans&quot;;font-size:12.0pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:left;direction:ltr;\">The header matches regular widgets: name, divider and three-dot menu.</li><li value=\"4\" style=\"font-weight:300;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;background-color:inherit;color:#666666;font-family:&quot;Fira Sans&quot;;font-size:12.0pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:left;direction:ltr;\">Settings saves a nonblank name and highlight; there is no AI header badge.</li><li value=\"5\" style=\"font-weight:300;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;background-color:inherit;color:#666666;font-family:&quot;Fira Sans&quot;;font-size:12.0pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:left;direction:ltr;\">Advanced widgets lists the new item for reuse with independent settings.</li><li value=\"6\" style=\"font-weight:300;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;background-color:inherit;color:#666666;font-family:&quot;Fira Sans&quot;;font-size:12.0pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:left;direction:ltr;\">Existing widget creation flows remain available.</li></ul></div></section></div>",
